<title>PHILIPPINES: SM Development Q3 net at 26.04 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>SM Development Q3 net at 26.04 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine property holding firm SM Development Corp said on Wednesday net income after tax for the quarter ended September 30 reached 26.04 million pesos.  </p>
<p>No other details were disclosed.</p>
<p>In the first six months of the year, the company reported a net income of 196.1 million pesos, a 12.8 percent increase from 173.8 million pesos in the same period last year. - Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 fax 8176267</p>
